Bundled C library
-----------------

src/api, src/cap, src/cls, src/core, src/der, src/drbg, src/hash,
src/hqc, src/mldsa, src/mlkem, src/slh and src/include/noqtis.h are an
unmodified copy of the noqtis C library
(https://github.com/rootcoder007/noqtis), made by tools/vendor.sh in
that repository:

  Copyright 2026 Vansh Singh Ruhela (rootcoder007)
  License: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception (see LICENSE.note)

The library is an independent implementation of public standards
(FIPS 180-4, FIPS 202, FIPS 203, FIPS 204, FIPS 205, SP 800-90A, the
HQC specification v5.0.0); it contains no third-party code.

Test fixtures
-------------

inst/extdata/capsule and tests/testthat/fixtures were made with the
noqtis library and are under the same licence, except
tests/testthat/fixtures/kat.txt: records copied from the repository's
tests/vectors, among them answers of the NIST ACVP sets (works of the
United States government) and the published BLAKE2b and Argon2 answers
(RFC 7693, RFC 9106, the BLAKE2 reference implementation); see
tests/vectors/SOURCES.md in the repository. No whole NIST or Wycheproof
test vector file is shipped in this package.

